{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game type: Strategy role-playing- srpg</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_01.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo only includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the 1st chapter(6 main stages), 3 side stages, and 1 gold stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will continue to be updated and new content will be added</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_02.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_03.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The development system of the demo version includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">character upgrades, character talents, skill equipment, and class-change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_04.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_06.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo content is the first chapter, the average playing time is about 80 minutes, and the total progress of the game is less than 10%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main story of the game is an original short story, so the characters and gameplay are relatively free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example, if you need to add your favorite characters, plots, and memes to the game, you can contact the author directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407110?t=1744816695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407110?t=1744816695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/7d258ef2cf2bcb249afa183b77afb36ef464916c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744816695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/7d258ef2cf2bcb249afa183b77afb36ef464916c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744816695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game type: Strategy role-playing- srpg</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407110/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_01.png?t=1744816695\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo only includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the 1st chapter(6 main stages), 3 side stages, and 1 gold stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will continue to be updated and new content will be adde